<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 26.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   McIntosh Sec	   11.25    0.80</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	10.54    0.93</p>
<p> 3   Prop Income Inv	10.21    1.00</p>
<p> 4   Villa World	    10.19    1.08</p>
<p> 5   Indu Property	  10.00    0.91</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.83    1.66</p>
<p> 7   Central Equity	  9.57    0.94</p>
<p> 8   Colonial Mutual	 9.28    1.14</p>
<p> 9   Centro Prop	     9.07    2.15</p>
<p>10   Gandel Retail Tr	9.07    0.86</p>
<p>11   Armstrong Retail	9.04    0.73</p>
<p>12   Aust Tour		 8.93    0.84</p>
